+#!/usr/bin/env python3
+"""Fixed release-source input boundary for the proposed Apple subtitle libraries.
+
+This file is a recovery proposal. It performs no download and never bootstraps
+Git sources. The SHA-256 values come from upstream release-asset metadata and
+maintained Android source pins; no upstream signature is verified.
+"""
+
